{{Quote|Fine. So what do you want, Ochi of&hellip; Bestoon. What exactly is a 'Bestoon'? Is that a planet or a&hellip; clan? Species?|[[Enric Pryde]], to Ochi of Bestoon|<ref name="Shadow of the Sith">''[[Shadow of the Sith]]''</ref>}}
'''Bestoon''' was a [[planet]]<ref name="Final Order">{{EncyclopediaCite|The Final Order and the Battle of Exegol}}</ref> located in the [[Bestoon system]] in the [[Colonies]] region of [[the galaxy]] in square J-9 on the [[Standard Galactic Grid]],<ref name="Appendix" /> which also fell in [[the Interior]].<ref name="Interior" /> It was the [[homeworld]] of [[Ochi]],<ref name="Final Order" /> a [[Bestoonian]]<ref name="Encyclopedia" /> [[Sith assassin]] [[Sith cultist|affiliated]] with the [[Sith Eternal]] [[Religion|cult]].<ref name="Final Order" /> The [[assassin]] was often addressed as Ochi of Bestoon<ref name="Ochi of Bestoon DB">{{Databank|ochi-of-bestoon|Ochi of Bestoon}}</ref> and wielded a ornate [[knife]] known as the [[Blade of Ochi of Bestoon]].<ref name="Blade databank">{{Databank|blade-of-ochi-of-bestoon|Blade of Ochi of Bestoon}}</ref> [[Gender|He]] also [[captain]]ed a [[Starship|ship]] named the ''[[Bestoon Legacy]]'', which was left with his [[droid]] [[D-O]] after the hunter's demise in a [[vexis]] [[Cave|burrow]] on [[Pasaana]]. The planet<ref name="Final Order" /> also lent its name to the [[Droid Crush Pirates of Bestoon]], a [[pirate]] group that worked with Ochi during the [[Galactic Civil War]]<ref name="Vader 9">[[Darth Vader (2020) 9|''Darth Vader'' (2020) 9]]</ref> and [[New Republic Era]].<ref name="Shadow of the Sith" />

